# PDFGuard settings. This file is never committed (it is in .gitignore).

# --- Option A (active): free, open model from Hugging Face running on your machine ---
PDFGUARD_PROVIDER=cerebras
# Default on a Mac with mlx-lm installed: mlx-community/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507-4bit (~2.5 GB download)
# Default otherwise (transformers):       Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507             (~8 GB download)
# Other choices (uncomment one):
# PDFGUARD_MODEL=mlx-community/gemma-3-4b-it-4bit
# PDFGUARD_MODEL=google/gemma-3-1b-it        # Gemma is gated: accept the licence on huggingface.co and set HF_TOKEN
# PDFGUARD_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B             # smaller and faster
# HF_TOKEN=                                  # only needed for gated models like Gemma

# --- Option B: Cerebras API (comment out PDFGUARD_PROVIDER above) ---
# (Option B active above)
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=
# PDFGUARD_RPM=20            # max requests per minute; lower it if you still see rate-limit messages

# --- Option C: Hugging Face Inference Providers API (needs credits) ---
# PDFGUARD_PROVIDER=huggingface
# HF_TOKEN=
